 of (&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sin( A + B ) + sin ( A - B )</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">cos( A + B ) + cos( A - B )</span></div>&nbsp;+ 1).&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 6tanA = 5 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; ( <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sin( A + B ) + sin ( A - B )</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">cos( A + B ) + cos( A - B )</span></div> + 1) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">11/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">11/5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">13/6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">13/6</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">11/6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">11/6</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">13/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">13/5</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Given,</p><p>6tanA = 5</p><p>tanA = 5/6</p><p>We know that,</p><p>sin(A + B) + sin(A - B)= 2sinAcosB</p><p>cos(A + B) + cos (A - B) = 2cosAcosB</p><p>Now,</p><p>(2sinAcosB/2cosAcosB) + 1</p><p>= tanA + 1</p><p>= (5/6) + 1 = 11/6</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If sec <i>a</i> = X and cosec <i>a</i> = Y, then X<sup>2 </sup>+ Y<sup>2</sup> = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sec <i>a</i> = X &#2324;&#2352; cosec <i>a</i> = Y &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; X<sup>2 </sup>+ Y<sup>2</sup>=?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">XY</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">XY</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> - XY</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup>-XY</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup> + XY</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup>+XY</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup></span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Given: sec<i>a</i> = X and cosec<i>a</i> = Y</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> = sec<sup>2</sup>a + cosec<sup>2</sup>a</p><p>= {1}/{cos<sup>2</sup>a} + {1}/{sin<sup>2</sup>a}</p><p>= {sin<sup>2</sup>a + cos<sup>2</sup>a}/{sin<sup>2</sup>a&#215;cos<sup>2</sup>a}</p><p>We know that cos<sup>2</sup>a + sin<sup>2</sup>a = 1</p><p>So, X<sup>2</sup> + Y<sup>2</sup> = <inlineformula>{1}/{sin<sup>2</sup>a&#215;cos<sup>2</sup>a}</inlineformula> = cosec<sup>2</sup>a&#215;sec<sup>2</sup>a = X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>What is tanA + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>tanA</span></div> + sin<span><sup>2</sup></span> A +  <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>1 + tan<span><sup>2</sup></span> A</span></div> equal to &#58;&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>tanA + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>tanA</span></div> + sin<span><sup>2</sup></span> A +  <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>1 + tan<span><sup>2</sup></span> A</span></div> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;?</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1 + sec A</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1 + sec A</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1 + sec A cosec A</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1 + sec A cosec A</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">sec A cosec A</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">sec A cosec A</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">tan<sup>2</sup> A + 1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">tan A</span></div>&nbsp;+ sin<sup>2</sup> A +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">sec<sup>2</sup> A</span></div>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sec<sup>2</sup> A</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">tan A</span></div>&nbsp;+ sin<sup>2</sup> A + cos<sup>2</sup> A&nbsp;&nbsp;= 1 + sec A cosec A&nbsp;</div></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">(cot<sup>2</sup> &theta; - 1)<sup>2</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">(1 - tan<sup>2</sup> &theta;)<sup>2</sup></span></div>&nbsp;= ?&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>((cot<sup>2</sup>&#952; -1)/(1-tan<sup>2</sup>&#952;))<sup>2 </sup>= ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">cot<sup>3</sup> &#952;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">cot<sup>3</sup> &#952;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">tan<sup>4</sup> &#952;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">tan<sup>4</sup> &#952;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">cot<sup>4</sup> &#952;</spa