lock; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&radic;(b<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup>)</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; SinA = <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">b</span></div> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?: <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">Sin 2A</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&radic;(b<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup>)</span></div></div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2a/b</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2a/b</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2a<sup>2</sup>/b</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2a<sup>2</sup>/b</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2a/b<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2a/b<sup>2</sup></span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>SinA = a/b, then CosA = &radic;[1  -  Sin<sup>2</sup>A] = &radic;(b<sup>2</sup>  -  a<sup>2</sup>)/b</p><p>Value of Sin2A/&radic;(b<sup>2</sup>  -  a<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>=&gt; 2SinACosA/&radic;(b<sup>2</sup>  -  a<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>=&gt; [2 * (a/b) * (&radic;(b<sup>2</sup>  -  a<sup>2</sup>)/b)]/ &radic;(b<sup>2</sup>  -  a<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>=&gt; 2a/b<sup>2</sup></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the value of &#952; from the given expression:</p><p><div>&nbsp;cosec<sup>2</sup> &theta; -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">sec<sup>2</sup> &theta;</span></div>&nbsp;= 1&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2360;&#2375; &#952; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;-</p><p><div>&nbsp;cosec<sup>2</sup> &theta; -&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">sec<sup>2</sup> &theta;</span></div> = 1</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">30&deg;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">30<sup>0</sup></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">45&deg;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">45<sup>0</sup></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">75&deg;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">75<sup>0</sup></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">15&deg;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15<sup>0</sup></span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  2/sec<sup>2</sup>&#952; = 1</p><p>=> 2/sec<sup>2</sup>&#952; = cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  1</p><p>=> 2/sec<sup>2</sup>&#952; = cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>=> 2 = sec<sup>2</sup>&#952; * cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>=> sin<sup>2</sup>&#952; = 1/2</p><p>=> sin&#952; = 1/&radic;2</p><p>=> &#952; = 45&deg;</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The value of [tan<sup>2</sup>32&deg; - cos<sup>2</sup>58&deg;]sec<sup>2</sup>58&deg;cot<sup>2</sup>32&deg; is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>[tan<sup>2</sup>32&deg; - cos<sup>2</sup>58&deg;]sec<sup>2</sup>58&deg;cot<sup>2</sup>32&deg; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-2</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>[tan<sup>2</sup>32&deg; - cos<sup>2</sup>58&deg;]sec<sup>2</sup>58&deg;cot<sup>2</sup>32&deg;</p><p>= [sin<sup>2</sup>32&deg;/cos<sup>2</sup>32&deg; - cos<sup>2</sup>(90 - 32&deg;)]sec<sup>2</sup>(90 - 32&deg;)cot<sup>2</sup>32&deg;</p><p>= sin<sup>2</sup>32&deg;(sec<sup>2</sup>32&deg; - 1)cosec<sup>2</sup>32&deg; cot<sup>2</sup>32&deg;</p><p>= tan<sup>2</sup>32&deg;cot<sup>2</sup>32&deg;</p><p>= 1</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If X(sin<sup>2</sup> 57&deg; - cos<sup>2</sup> 33&deg;) + 4(cosec<sup>2</sup> 61&deg; - tan<sup>2</sup> 29&deg;) + cos<sup>2</sup> 45&deg; =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">X</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3</span></div>&nbsp;, then value of X is -&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X(sin<sup>2</sup> 57&deg; - cos<sup>2</sup> 33&deg;) + 4(cosec<sup>2</sup> 61&deg; - tan<sup>2</sup> 29&deg;) + cos<sup>2</sup> 45&deg; = <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">X</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3</span></div> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">27/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">27/2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">23/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">23/2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">25/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">25/2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">29/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">29/2</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p><img width=395 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18553/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=448 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18553/image003.png\"></p><p><img width=343 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18553/image004.png\"></p><p><img width=65 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18553/image005.png\"></p><p><img width=49 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18553/image006.png\"></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The minimum value of 7 sin<sup>2</sup> A + 9 cos<sup>2</sup> A is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>7 sin<sup>2</sup> A + 9 cos<sup>2</sup> A &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2344;&#2340;&#2350; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>7 sin<sup>2</sup> A + 9 cos<sup>2</sup> A</p><p>=7 sin<sup>2</sup> A + 7 cos<sup>2</sup> A + 2 cos<sup>2</sup> A</p><p>= 7 + 2 cos<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>The minimum value of cos A = -1, here square of cosA is given and we know that the value of any square function lies between 0 and 1 and therefore, the minimum value of cos<sup>2</sup>A = 0.</p><p>So, 7 + 0 = 7</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;Evaluate:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sec<sup>2</sup> &theta; - 2 sin<sup>2</sup> &theta; + 1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">tan<sup>2</sup> &theta; cos<sup>2</sup> &theta;</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; :<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sec<sup>2</sup> &theta; - 2 sin<sup>2</sup> &theta; + 1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">tan<sup>2</sup> &theta; cos<sup>2</sup> &theta;</span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">sec<sup>2</sup>&#952; + 2cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">sec<sup>2</sup>&#952; + 2cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2sec&#952;cot&#952;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2sec&#952;cot&#952;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2tan&#952;cos&#952;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2tan&#952;cos&#952;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">sec &#952; + 2cot<sup> </sup>&#952;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">sec &#952; + 2cot<sup> </sup>&#952;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p><img width=127 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8370/image006.png\"></p><p>= <img width=149 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8370/image007.png\"></p><p>= <img width=108 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8370/image008.png\"></p><p>= <img width=181 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8370/image009.png\"></p><p>= <img width=101 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p8370/image010.png\"></p><p>= sec<sup>2</sup>&#952; + 2cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;Evaluate:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">tan<sup>2</sup> A(cosec A - 1)</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">1 + cos A</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><div>&nbsp;&#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">tan<sup>2</sup> A(cosec A - 1)</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">1 + cos A</span></div></div></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">sinA/ [(1 - sinA) * (1 + cosA)]</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">sinA/ [(1 - sinA) * (1 + cosA)]</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">sinA/ [(1 + sinA) * (1 + cosA)]</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">sinA/ [(1 + sinA) * (1 + cosA)]</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">sinA/ [(1 - sinA) * (1 - cosA)]</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">sinA/ [(1 - sinA) * (1 - cosA)]</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">sinA/ [(1 + sinA) * (1 - cosA)]</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">sinA/ [(1 + sinA) * (1 - cosA)]</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p><img width=123 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image082.png\"></p><p><img width=125 height=57 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image083.png\"></p><p><img width=132 height=57 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image084.png\"></p><p><img width=145 height=48 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image085.png\"></p><p><img width=207 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image086.png\"></p><p><img width=144 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image087.png\"></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If p = Sin A + Cos A and q = Sin A -  Cos A, then what is the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">p<sup>2</sup> - 1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">1 - q<sup>2</sup></span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; p = Sin A + Cos A &#2324;&#2352; q = Sin A - Cos A &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; p<sup style=\"text-align: center;\">2</sup> - 1/1 - q<sup style=\"text-align: center;\">2 </sup>&#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>p = SinA + CosA (Given)</p><p>p<sup>2</sup> = (SinA + CosA)<sup>2</sup> = Sin<sup>2</sup>A + Cos<sup>2</sup>A + 2SinACosA = 1 + Sin2A</p><p>q = SinA  -  CosA</p><p>q<sup>2</sup> = (SinA  -  CosA)<sup>2</sup> = Sin<sup>2</sup>A + Cos<sup>2</sup>A  -  2SinACosA = 1  -  Sin2A</p><p>Now the value of expression = (p<sup>2</sup>  -  1)/(1  -  q<sup>2</sup>) = (1 + Sin2A  -  1)/(1  -  1 + Sin2A)</p><p>=&gt; Sin2A/Sin2A = 1</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>Solve the following expression <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>(1 + sin&#952;)</span></div> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>(1 - sin&#952;)</span></div>.&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379; &#2361;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;: <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>(1 + sin&#952;)</span></div> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>(1 - sin&#952;)</span></div></div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2sec<sup>2</sup>&#952;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2sec<sup>2</sup>&#952;</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>1/(1 + sin&#952;) + 1/(1 -&nbsp;sin&#952;)&nbsp;</p><p><span>= [(1 - sin&#952; + 1 + sin&#952;) / (1 - sin</span><span><sup>2</sup></span><span>&#952;)]</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;= 2/cos</span><span><sup>2</sup></span><span>&#160;&#952;</span></p><p><span>= 2sec</span><span><sup>2</sup></span><span>&#160;&#952;</span></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the value of (cos<sup>2</sup>40&deg; + cos<sup>2</sup>50&deg;)/(sec<sup>2</sup>30&deg; - 1)?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(cos<sup>2</sup>40&deg; + cos<sup>2</sup>50&deg;)/(sec<sup>2</sup>30&deg; - 1) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&radic;3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>(cos<sup>2</sup>40&deg; + cos<sup>2</sup>50&deg;)/(sec<sup>2</sup>30&deg; - 1)</p><p>= (cos<sup>2</sup>40&deg; + sin<sup>2</sup>40&deg;)/(tan<sup>2</sup>30&deg;)</p><p>= 1/(1/3)</p><p>= 3</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}